          "Start the map by naming the the CRM field the escalation log action is supposed to change. A reviewer should open the renewal risk memo from the case without asking for a screenshot or searching a personal drive. The exception note should say which value was used, which was rejected, and why. Keep the renewal risk memo in the approved repository and link it to the case. At Customer Success Managers, the November 2 escalation log review should name the backup owner and coverage window.",
          "A complete escalation log evidence set shows request, usage report, owner decision, action, and the resulting the health dashboard value. A reviewer should open the usage report from the case without asking for a screenshot or searching a personal drive. When the usage report is incomplete, pausing escalation log is safer than filling the gap with a guess. Keep the usage report in the approved repository and link it to the case. The November 2 escalation log exception log should show the reason code, owner, and release decision."
