          "A monthly escalation log review should test a small random sample, not the cases that are easiest to explain. If the sample shows missing escalation record attachments, fix the request form before coaching people. Separate observation, inference, and recommendation. Keep the sampled case keys so the test can be repeated. The November 2 escalation log close should name the destination field, approver, and reopen rate check.",
